  "notes": "どうも has multiple uses.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- どうも (casual thanks/greeting)\n- どうもありがとう (thank you very much)\n- どうもすみません (I'm very sorry)\n\nUSAGES:\n- As standalone greeting: どうも (Hi/Thanks)\n- Emphasizer: どうも + adjective\n- Uncertainty: どうも〜らしい (it seems that...)",
